# Two players, battle mode (gRace 6) in its arena (track 6), split screen, on the retail cartridge: what
# tools/port/synth/battle2p.press does on the synthetic one. The retail mode screen of two players lists four modes
# (single race, practice, stunt, battle) and draws them in over about 2 s, so battle is three down once they are in;
# battle2p.press's five down (the synthetic cartridge's seven modes, mode 5 locked) wrap round to practice here
# (docs/port/QA.md, "Integration QA"). Run with synth_compare.py --script (docs/port/MORECARS.md 10.4), which checks
# the expect line.
# until: 0x400000:600
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 2, windows 2, cars 2, mode 6, track 6
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
9 RIGHT 0.1    # the main menu's first option: two players
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen: both ready
14 A@2
17 DOWN 0.1    # the mode screen, its list in: three down
17.5 DOWN 0.1
18 DOWN 0.1
19.5 A         # battle mode
22.5 A         # the track select: the battle arena
25.5 A         # the car select: each player's car
25.5 A@2
